{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.25.17.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19df860d116d08ae24aed7fcb959523a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone! January 2017 bride here! Wedding will be at Finest Playa Mujeres :) , so excited!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914544,"PostDate":1466769181,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone! January 2017 bride here! Wedding will be at Finest Playa Mujeres <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> , so excited!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hmfreeman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.25.17.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447939411,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hmsm","Id":285386,"Name":"hmsm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"4.30.208.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6681a581023eb58c865a07bd17a39d95","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"Hola20162\"],\n\nI used wedding wire. It&#039;s free and very easy to use. All the information my guests need is on it. I did pay for a custom url thought, only because I didn&#039;t want to have a long url on my STDs and invites.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914555,"PostDate":1466942095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287215\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287215-hola20162\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hola20162<\/span><\/a>,<br>\nI used wedding wire. It's free and very easy to use. All the information my guests need is on it. I did pay for a custom url thought, only because I didn't want to have a long url on my STDs and invites.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.98.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1467051739,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"423d47a8f4ee425637fc70b69e90e9f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Hola20162:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hello, i did &amp;nbsp;a web site for my friends &amp;nbsp;with wix, it was really good, &amp;nbsp;you have to buy a domain ( around 10 dollars per year) and you can do hosting monthly, feel free to check it out&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/vhermosill6.wix.com\/bienvenido-a-la-boda&#039;&gt;http:\/\/vhermosill6.wix.com\/bienvenido-a-la-boda&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914564,"PostDate":1467050100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Hola20162:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hello, i did \u00a0a web site for my friends \u00a0with wix, it was really good, \u00a0you have to buy a domain ( around 10 dollars per year) and you can do hosting monthly, feel free to check it out<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/vhermosill6.wix.com\/bienvenido-a-la-boda' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/vhermosill6.w...enido-a-la-boda<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465480401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1469625864","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.53.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1467536504,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"987e28bebce7b466f9e060ac22082bbb","RawContent":"Hello fellow 2017 DW brides!!! I&#039;m getting married on March 7, 2017 on the Sky Deck at the Azul Sensatori in Riviera Maya, Mexico.\n\n\nOur ceremony, reception and welcome dinner venues are booked, we have selected a photographer and placed our deposit, and we have chosen our menu choices for each event.  I also bought my dress.\n\n\nInvites have been sent and our deposit deadline is in less than two weeks.  YIKES!!! I am eager to get a rough headcount so I can begin DIYing. \n\n\nOf course, none of the above has been without some drama. Like many other brides, I am attempting to keep cool under pressure - celebrate the victories and quickly get over the disappointments. \n\n\nSo glad to have found this website. It&#039;s been a wealth of information\/ideas and has been a wonderful support in times of stress\/disappointment. I look forward to sharing with all of you as we ride this DW rollercoaster together!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914621,"PostDate":1467536449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello fellow 2017 DW brides!!! I'm getting married on March 7, 2017 on the Sky Deck at the Azul Sensatori in Riviera Maya, Mexico.<br><br>\nOur ceremony, reception and welcome dinner venues are booked, we have selected a photographer and placed our deposit, and we have chosen our menu choices for each event.  I also bought my dress.<br><br>\nInvites have been sent and our deposit deadline is in less than two weeks.  YIKES!!! I am eager to get a rough headcount so I can begin DIYing. <br><br>\nOf course, none of the above has been without some drama. Like many other brides, I am attempting to keep cool under pressure - celebrate the victories and quickly get over the disappointments. <br><br>\nSo glad to have found this website. It's been a wealth of information\/ideas and has been a wonderful support in times of stress\/disappointment. I look forward to sharing with all of you as we ride this DW rollercoaster together!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lperrier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.65.225.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431514421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283084.jpg?_r=1469546129","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeanneP","Id":283084,"Name":"LeanneP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.145.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfec2798839bd48c65a1f8bc5b61ba83","RawContent":"@[member=\"LeanneP\"] congrats! My biggest advice to you is once you get past your deadline is to remember more people will inevitably book after your deadline. I starting diying right after our deadline and bought a few extra of everything but now I&#039;m having to go back and buy even more because more people keep on booking lol. I&#039;ve run into a couple of issues with this because some of the stuff I ordered had minimum quantities and now I don&#039;t meet the requirements to purchase. We were incredible shocked and touched with how many people chose to come. We were expecting 20 and are now up to 51.  \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1914622,"PostDate":1467546107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283084\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283084-leannep\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LeanneP<\/span><\/a> congrats! My biggest advice to you is once you get past your deadline is to remember more people will inevitably book after your deadline. I starting diying right after our deadline and bought a few extra of everything but now I'm having to go back and buy even more because more people keep on booking lol. I've run into a couple of issues with this because some of the stuff I ordered had minimum quantities and now I don't meet the requirements to purchase. We were incredible shocked and touched with how many people chose to come. We were expecting 20 and are now up to 51.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"setteewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.145.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1456262677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286318.jpg?_r=1456278648","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WPGBride17","Id":286318,"Name":"WPGBride17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.53.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd5cbb6cd70e63d9389efda29b0659c3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"WPGBride17\" post=\"1914622\" timestamp=\"1467560507\"]\n@[member=\"LeanneP\"] congrats! My biggest advice to you is once you get past your deadline is to remember more people will inevitably book after your deadline. I starting diying right after our deadline and bought a few extra of everything but now I&#039;m having to go back and buy even more because more people keep on booking lol. I&#039;ve run into a couple of issues with this because some of the stuff I ordered had minimum quantities and now I don&#039;t meet the requirements to purchase. We were incredible shocked and touched with how many people chose to come. We were expecting 20 and are now up to 51.  \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Thanks for the advice WPG Bride!!! It is rather nerve racking isn&#039;t it?","Attachments":[],"Id":1914624,"PostDate":1467548452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>WPGBride17, on 03 July 2016 - 11:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283084\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283084-leannep\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LeanneP<\/span><\/a> congrats! My biggest advice to you is once you get past your deadline is to remember more people will inevitably book after your deadline. I starting diying right after our deadline and bought a few extra of everything but now I'm having to go back and buy even more because more people keep on booking lol. I've run into a couple of issues with this because some of the stuff I ordered had minimum quantities and now I don't meet the requirements to purchase. We were incredible shocked and touched with how many people chose to come. We were expecting 20 and are now up to 51.  <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks for the advice WPG Bride!!! It is rather nerve racking isn't it?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lperrier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.65.225.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431514421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283084.jpg?_r=1469546129","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeanneP","Id":283084,"Name":"LeanneP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3477b0331b7469b0c1df443c44efcd1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MaraO\" post=\"1913110\" timestamp=\"1461640391\"]\nHello all I just got engaged and our goal is to have a wedding in Cabo\nWe want the Rui palace but we just found out they will be closed 8\/16-12\/16 for renovation. The Gazebo we want may not be available... They can&#039;t guarantee it! Ugh\nAny other suggestions?!?!?[\/quote]Setting up a small arch on the beach. Have the hotel coordinator set up ideas and take photos of them to send to you. \n\nHope this Helps ; ) \n[quote name=\"MaraO\" post=\"1913110\" timestamp=\"1461640391\"]\nHello all I just got engaged and our goal is to have a wedding in Cabo\nWe want the Rui palace but we just found out they will be closed 8\/16-12\/16 for renovation. The Gazebo we want may not be available... They can&#039;t guarantee it! Ugh\nAny other suggestions?!?!?[\/quote]Setting up a small arch on the beach. Have the hotel coordinator set up ideas and take photos of them to send to you. \n\nHope this Helps ; )","Attachments":[],"Id":1914641,"PostDate":1467643995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MaraO, on 25 April 2016 - 11:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello all I just got engaged and our goal is to have a wedding in Cabo<br>\nWe want the Rui palace but we just found out they will be closed 8\/16-12\/16 for renovation. The Gazebo we want may not be available... They can't guarantee it! Ugh<br>\nAny other suggestions?!?!?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Setting up a small arch on the beach. Have the hotel coordinator set up ideas and take photos of them to send to you.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this Helps ; )\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MaraO, on 25 April 2016 - 11:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello all I just got engaged and our goal is to have a wedding in Cabo<br>\nWe want the Rui palace but we just found out they will be closed 8\/16-12\/16 for renovation. The Gazebo we want may not be available... They can't guarantee it! Ugh<br>\nAny other suggestions?!?!?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Setting up a small arch on the beach. Have the hotel coordinator set up ideas and take photos of them to send to you.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this Helps ; )\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melisakeltner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315915584,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245258.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YS Studios","Id":245258,"Name":"YS Studios","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d7bf1087e4615a5f3e61fe452663a3c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are doing a vow renewal February 22nd of 2017 in Antigua Guatemala.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914650,"PostDate":1467647997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are doing a vow renewal February 22nd of 2017 in Antigua Guatemala.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melisakeltner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315915584,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245258.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YS Studios","Id":245258,"Name":"YS Studios","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.43.81","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"537f389b59de89560baebe6bf642ac81","RawContent":"@[member=\"LeanneP\"] it is definitely near be racking especially waiting for the deadline but in the end I know it will be awesome. I find the people on this forum help with the nerves though. I&#039;m so glad I found it!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1914651,"PostDate":1467648331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283084\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283084-leannep\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LeanneP<\/span><\/a> it is definitely near be racking especially waiting for the deadline but in the end I know it will be awesome. I find the people on this forum help with the nerves though. I'm so glad I found it!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"setteewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.145.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1456262677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286318.jpg?_r=1456278648","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WPGBride17","Id":286318,"Name":"WPGBride17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.127.211.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28da342f1d7e4a51242517eca851d8bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Hola20162\"] We went with weddingwire.com so far it&#039;s been great for what we need. But a bunch of my friends went with mywedding.com it seems it&#039;s more customizable?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914653,"PostDate":1467664631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287215\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287215-hola20162\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hola20162<\/span><\/a> We went with weddingwire.com so far it's been great for what we need. But a bunch of my friends went with mywedding.com it seems it's more customizable?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407859786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
