> User gturano721 (287071)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.216.199.166","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95adc6ebd7e43b3371a5498b818893f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We&#039;re working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I&#039;m waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)&amp;nbsp; :wacko:&amp;nbsp;Wedding website is up and running. I&#039;m still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that&#039;s still up for review.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So glad to have found this forum!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914677,"PostDate":1467719222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We're working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I'm waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\u00a0Wedding website is up and running. I'm still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that's still up for review.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So glad to have found this forum!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nylammeg@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.245.138.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1461153370,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286774.jpg?_r=1467731972","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gaichan","Id":286774,"Name":"gaichan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.79.196","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80055,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e43b75e1793f57bec918bf173214667","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mangosong\" post=\"1914653\" timestamp=\"1467679031\"]\n@[member=\"Hola20162\"] We went with weddingwire.com so far it&#039;s been great for what we need. But a bunch of my friends went with mywedding.com it seems it&#039;s more customizable?[\/quote]I used weddingwire.com as well and love it! It was super easy to use and the ability to create guest lists and track your RSVPs, meal selections and even create a seating plan is awesome. No complaints so far. It will surely be a life saver!\n[quote name=\"gaichan\" post=\"1914677\" timestamp=\"1467733622\"]\nHey everyone! \n \nOur ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We&#039;re working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I&#039;m waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)  :wacko: Wedding website is up and running. I&#039;m still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that&#039;s still up for review.\n \nSo glad to have found this forum![\/quote]The photographer was my hardest decision so far. It&#039;s SO expensive but I figure at the end of the day, the photos are what you will have to look at decades later after some of the memories have faded. It took a little convincing as my FI had sticker shock but at the end of the day, he just wants me to be happy. And after I showed him examples of the photographer&#039;s work, he was blown away that they were \"art\" and not just the cheesy posed photos of yester year. It is definitely one of the harder (and more expensive!) decisions to make.  Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914680,"PostDate":1467721435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mangosong, on 04 July 2016 - 08:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287215\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287215-hola20162\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hola20162<\/span><\/a> We went with weddingwire.com so far it's been great for what we need. But a bunch of my friends went with mywedding.com it seems it's more customizable?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI used weddingwire.com as well and love it! It was super easy to use and the ability to create guest lists and track your RSVPs, meal selections and even create a seating plan is awesome. No complaints so far. It will surely be a life saver!<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>gaichan, on 05 July 2016 - 11:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hey everyone!\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nOur ceremony date and venue is booked for Nov 11, 2017 at Grand Sunset Princess. We're working with a TA and got a room block booked and deposits are due in 2 weeks. I'm waiting to see how many guests we have before we book our reception (a lot of guests are not willing to commit this far in advance)\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\u00a0Wedding website is up and running. I'm still in the process of convincing the FH that we need a photographer and\/or videographer, so that's still up for review.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSo glad to have found this forum!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThe photographer was my hardest decision so far. It's SO expensive but I figure at the end of the day, the photos are what you will have to look at decades later after some of the memories have faded. It took a little convincing as my FI had sticker shock but at the end of the day, he just wants me to be happy. And after I showed him examples of the photographer's work, he was blown away that they were \"art\" and not just the cheesy posed photos of yester year. It is definitely one of the harder (and more expensive!) decisions to make.  Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lperrier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.65.225.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431514421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283084.jpg?_r=1469546129","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeanneP","Id":283084,"Name":"LeanneP","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
